All Community Events\nQuick Links\nAbout Us\nBirth & Death Certificates\nEmergency Medical Services\nFrequently Asked Questions (FAQ's)\nGIS Parcel Viewer\nHunting Licenses\nPay Taxes Online\nPembina County Alerts Severe Weather Sign Up\nProperty Tax Information\nReport Sign Damage\nElection Information\nPublic Health Client Intake Form\nPembina County Resource Guide 2025\nCAVALIER WEATHER\nWelcome to Pembina County!\nWelcome to the Pembina County North Dakota Web site. We invite you to look at what Pembina County has to offer. From four season's recreation to an attractive business climate, we offer you a great place to live, work and play.\nOur Web site is here to provide you with information on many different areas of the county including county government, local businesses, cities and recreation. There are links to resources at the State of North Dakota and Pembina County cities.\nWe hope you enjoy your experience browsing through here and welcome you back as we make changes and updates.\nCounty\nBoards\nContacts\nCounty News\nDepartments\nEmployment\nFarmers Meeting Room\nLinks\nMaps\nCommunity\nArea Attractions\nDevelopment\nQuality of Life\nRelocation Information\nEmployee Login\nPembina County\n301 Dakota Street W. #1\nCavalier, ND 58220\n701-265-4231\n© Pembina County\nPrivacy Policy\nDisclaimer\nSite Map\nAccessibility",
